doc ///
  Key
    complement
    (complement, Matrix)
  Headline
    find the minimal generators for cokernel of a matrix (low level form)
  Description
    Text
      @TT "complement f"@ -- for a matrix @TT "f"@, return a map @TT "g"@ with
      the same target whose columns are minimal generators for the cokernel of
      @TT "f"@.

      The map @TT "f"@ must be homogeneous.
///
